@startuml 16-service-connections
title Kết nối giữa các service — REST đồng bộ · sự kiện Kafka · MCP · SSE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam component<<new>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF4D6
  BorderColor #C08A00
}
skinparam component<<extend>> {
  BackgroundColor #E6F0FF
  BorderColor #2F6FB3
}

component "frontend" <<extend>> as FE
component "kong + keycloak" <<extend>> as KONG

package "Agent" {
  component "workflow-runtime" <<extend>> as WR
  component "mcp-gateway" <<new>> as MCPG
}

package "Chỉ số" {
  component "indicator-catalog-svc" <<new>> as CAT
  component "observation-svc" <<new>> as OBS
  component "compute-svc" <<new>> as CMP
  component "alert-svc" <<new>> as ALR
  component "report-svc" <<new>> as RPT
}

package "Ingestion" {
  component "source-registry-svc" <<new>> as SRC
  component "Dagster + connectors" <<new>> as DAG
  component "extraction-svc" <<new>> as EXT
  component "mapping-svc" <<new>> as MAP
  component "data-quality-svc" <<new>> as DQ
  component "curation-svc" <<new>> as CUR
}

package "Tri thức · Chất lượng" {
  component "kb-backend" <<extend>> as KB
  component "eval-svc" <<new>> as EVAL
  component "metadata-lineage-svc" <<new>> as LIN
  component "notification-svc" <<new>> as NOTI
}

FE --> KONG : HTTPS REST · SSE
KONG --> WR : /api/orchestrate (SSE)

note right of KONG
  Kong định tuyến tiếp:
  /api/indicators → indicator-catalog-svc
  /api/query → compute-svc
  /api/series → observation-svc
  /api/alerts → alert-svc
  /api/reports → report-svc
  /api/sources → source-registry-svc
  /api/reviews → curation-svc
  /api/eval → eval-svc
  /api/notifications (SSE) → notification-svc
  /api/knowledge → kb-backend
end note

WR --> MCPG : MCP (Streamable HTTP)
MCPG --> CAT : REST
MCPG --> CMP : REST
MCPG --> KB : REST
MCPG --> RPT : REST
CMP --> OBS : REST
CMP --> CAT : REST (cache)
DAG --> SRC : REST (cấu hình · lịch)
MAP --> CAT : REST (biến · codelist)
CUR --> EXT : REST (ảnh trang · bbox)
RPT --> CMP : REST
EVAL --> WR : REST (chạy câu hỏi)
EVAL --> OBS : REST (đáp án từ quan sát)

DAG ..> EXT : artifact.stored
DAG ..> KB : artifact.stored (văn bản)
EXT ..> MAP : extraction.completed
MAP ..> DQ : mapping.proposed
DQ ..> CUR : validation.completed
CUR ..> OBS : review.approved
OBS ..> CMP : observation.published
OBS ..> LIN : observation.published
OBS ..> EVAL : observation.published
CAT ..> CMP : indicator.version.approved
CAT ..> EVAL : indicator.version.approved
CMP ..> ALR : indicator.recomputed
ALR ..> NOTI : alert.raised
RPT ..> NOTI : report.completed
EVAL ..> NOTI : eval.completed

legend bottom
  Nét liền = REST đồng bộ (nội bộ ký X-Service-Assertion) · Nét đứt = sự kiện Kafka · MCP chỉ dùng giữa agent và mcp-gateway
endlegend
@enduml
